5431 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The withdrawal flow treats each provider\031s reported accounting balance as immediately withdrawable liquidity and processes providers in a fixed order\056 If an earlier provider cannot satisfy the requested amount and reverts\054 the transaction stops before later providers are considered\056\nThis can occur with MorphoProvider\054 where getDepositBalance\050\051 returns the asset value of the vault\031s MetaMorpho shares\056 This value may remain positive while borrowing activity reduces the assets immediately available for withdrawal\056 Consequently\054 a withdrawal may revert even when a later provider holds sufficient liquidity\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 5432 0 R
     /Pg 2706 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

